or
    REJECT    - the transaction stands.

Add a line starting with NOTE: to record your reasoning; it is shown to the customer.

Keep the reference {{ $('Raise Dispute').item.json.ops_ref_code }} in the reply - it is already in the subject line. This reference expires in 7 days.

===BANKING-OPS-ACTION===
